zoe de chanel has been largely absent  from our screens over the past couple of  years  but happily it's for several solid  reasons  here's why you haven't seen zoe de  chanel in tv or movies as much lately  from 2011 to 2018 zoe de chanel starred  as jessica day  a sweet quirky teacher who moves in with  three strangers in los angeles  after a terrible breakup on the hit  comedy new girl  who's jess though the role netted her  emmy and golden globe nominations  it may have also pigeonholed her as a  performer there's no question that  jess and deschanel share a lot of traits  from their musical talents to their love  of vintage clothing and early seasons of  new girl  really leaned on those similarities the  show sharpened a bit  in later seasons and even poked fun at  jess's highly manicured quirkiness  unfortunately if you didn't invest in  new girl long term  you missed all that evolution which  potentially made her harder to cast in  roles that differed too drastically from  jess  between her leading role on new girl and  her starring turn  alongside joseph gordon levitt in 500  days of summer the fact is that many of  deschanel's most high-profile characters  fit the definition of the manic pixie  dream girl  a term coined by critic nathan rabin  after he saw cameron crowe's 2005 film  elizabethtown it became a catch-all  phrase for quirky female characters  and unfortunately deschanel fit the  stereotype to a t  at least superficially for example 500  days of summer's leading lady  summer could best be described as a  manic pixie dream girl  by detractors who would prefer to ignore  the depths of the character  as well as the strength of deschanel's  performance diminishing summer to a girl  who loves vintage clothes  is tweely eccentric and who encourages  the film's male protagonist to make  big choices in his life rabin ultimately  apologized for even creating the concept  of a manic pixie dream girl years later  but the popularity of the trope  and its backlash may have affected  deschanel's opportunities in hollywood  plenty of actors have moved into  producing while still appearing in front  of the camera  even megawatt stars like brad pitt who  actually won his first academy award for  producing 12 years a slave  several years before he won a  competitive oscar for acting  zoe deschanel is no different in fact  she moved behind the camera on new girl  during its run  in 2011 she became a producer and from  2014  until the show ended in 2018 also served  as an executive producer  deschanel also ventured into producing  some other projects throughout her run  on new girl  even if she isn't appearing on screen in  other words  there's always a chance deschanel could  produce again if the right project  catches her eye aside from her acting  career  one of zoe deschanel's long time passion  projects  has been promoting vegan and vegetarian  lifestyles  while helping consumers understand where  their food actually comes from  for multiple seasons deschanel has  hosted the web series your foods roots  where she talks to farmers nutritionists  food historians  and other experts about how the food you  choose affects you  as well as the people around you larger  communities and  the earth as a whole in fact working on  the show  encouraged deschanel to become a  vegetarian to adopt more ethical food  practices  as she once explained to people magazine  she learned  so much about where her food was really  coming from that she began paying more  attention  the main thing is it's just so hard to  know where meat is coming from  it's so difficult to know if it was  sustainably raised or humanely raised  i really felt like i couldn't be sure  where it was coming from most of the  time  so i stopped eating meat near the height  of her career momentum in 2011  zoe deschanel found time to create a  place for women of all ages  online alongside co-founders molly  mcaleer  and sophia rossi deschanel founded hello  giggles  just as she landed her starring role on  new girl according to hello giggles  itself  the site is meant to serve as a quote  positive online community for female  identifying readers  and covers everything from beauty to  relationship to finance  to do this the site combines personal  essays with news  lists and columns in 2015  deschanel mclear and rossi sold hello  giggles to time  inc but still continued overseeing the  website as it gained an even wider  audience as deschanel told the los  angeles times in a statement  the purchase meant the trio and their  staff would be able to reach an even  wider audience through the resources  offered by time hello giggles is still  around to do that  today in 2015 zoe deschanel took on one  of the most important roles  of her life becoming a mother with the  birth of her first child  daughter elsie wolf in 2017 with  then-husband jacob pachenek she had a  son  charlie wolf before the couple parted  ways in 2019.  in 2018 deschanel told instyle that she  was in no rush to return to acting  preferring to focus on her children i'm  just looking for something that would be  exciting  and fulfilling for me i have two kids  and they're very important to me  i'm really focused on them so i want to  make sure that whatever i do next  is really good it has to be really good  for me to leave them  and go to work by deschanel's own  admission  she's also a very hands-on parent as she  also told in style  i mean i'm driving my kids to every  class every day  i'm there with them all the time it's  actually rare that i'm not with them  i try to be there as much as humanly  possible  ever since new girl ended in 2018  audiences haven't seen zoe deschanel on  screen  in an acting role but if you listen  closely to some recent  and huge children's movies you'll be  able to hear her distinctive voice  live action acting might be on hold but  voice acting is still a part of  deschanel's working life  in 2016 deschanel began appearing in the  enormously successful trolls franchise  voicing bridget a member of the  antagonistic bergen race  however bridget is a particularly sweet  bergen  harboring a secret crush on the prince  of the bergens  grissel jr and working as a scullery  maid  in the palace you love crystal too  you better back off girlfriend after the  first film  deschanel returned not only for the  much-anticipated 2020 sequel trolls  world tour  which marked her first acting gig since  2017  but she also appeared in nbc's trolls  holiday special  reprising her role as bridget in both  projects  whether it's to cater to her children or  just because voice work is a fun gig for  major actors to play with  deschanel is clearly doing well with her  work in the trolls movies  even throughout the highest highs of her  film and television career  zoe deschanel always kept her true  passion project  the band she and him alive alongside  partner  m ward the duo has released several  albums  and with deschanel on piano vocals and  ukulele and ward on guitar  the two strike a decidedly folksy sound  they've been quite successful  releasing 2008's volume 1 2010's volume  2 2013's volume 3 and a very she and tim  christmas  2014's classics and 2016's christmas  party  between albums ward and deschanel also  play live  as recently as 2019 the two were still  doing holiday tours  visiting several cities during the  season to spread musical cheer  in fact during their 2019 christmas  party tour  chanelle was spotted bringing her famous  boyfriend property brother jonathan  scott  on stage during a show at the met in  philadelphia  after a meeting during a taping of  carpool karaoke  in 2019 zoe deschanel and hgtv star  and property brother jonathan scott  started dating  and over time the two slowly made their  relationship  public throughout several cute instagram  posts and other milestones  deschanel and scott have opened up about  their relationship  and in december of 2020 deschanel put in  an appearance alongside scott  on his home network deschanel appeared  in an episode of the  hgtv series celebrity iou  which sees celebrities do special  construction and renovations favors for  friends  and loved ones via the hosting and  producing powers of the property  brothers  in this sweet installment deschanel  helps out a longtime friend  sarah who has been a part of her life  since kindergarten  by expanding her home into an open space  concept  beyond deschanel's amazing gesture it's  even cuter knowing that she's appearing  alongside scott  her real-life partner and supporting his  television ventures  zoe deschanel's blunt bangs adorkable  personality  and ukulele-fueled indie band have made  her an easily spoofable celebrity  over the years now that she's out of the  spotlight  deschanel is poking fun at herself and  even appeared in a music video alongside  katy perry to reference  a long-running joke there's no denying  that deschanel  and perry look eerily similar to the  point where perry  even admitted that she occasionally  pretended to be  deschanel to gain access to exclusive  events and clubs  finally in december of 2020 the duo made  light of their similarity when deschanel  starred in the music video for perry's  song  not the end of the world one of the  singles from her smile  album in the video deschanel plays an  unsuspecting human who finds herself  held captive by  aliens who really really like katy perry  and even try to get deschanel's  character to perform as the pop star  it's a bit that  perfectly capitalizes on the constant  claims that the two stars  are lookalikes check out one of our  newest videos right here  plus even more looper videos about your  favorite stars are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss  a single one
 

